...             29-Nov-2021             |       Remove of AirphoneConfig.xml for 1248-M + cleanup
...             02-Dec-2021             |       Move to WTS runner
...             02-Dec-2021             |       Remove RAD param related keywords (cleanup, useless now)
...             18-Jan-2022             |       Remove AP Config XML dependencies (no more used)
