...             30-May-2022             |       Fix LUA output (Uint8)
...             17-June-2022            |       Adaptation to use MC_SHARK
...             08-Sep-2022             |       Setting maxi for M55117C0052[8-9] to 3 instead 2 for managing configurations update with 2 cells
...             09-Sep-2022             |       Setting maxi for M55117C0053[2-3] to 3 instead 2 for managing configurations update with 2 cells
...             14-Apr-2023             |       Skip the Sherpa capture for VRAN because it would require a commissioning to create a route on Vdu
...             18-Sep-2024             |       Scout data

