*** Variables ***

#
# Dictionary embedding for each TC the expected counter values for such or such counter
# (e.g.: dict_kpis_tc_1248_J_69_M55319C02009)
# For each counter a min/max range is defined in a list type (e.g.: dict_kpis_tc_1248_J_69_M55319C02009)
# There is one such array for each TC (e.g.: dict_kpis_tc_1248_J_69)
# PM value generation is based on a script with a min/max 10 % margin. For example:
# ./list_counters_values.sh ~/5GC001248_refactoring/PMs_runs_auto/PM_15062021_1924/ J_1 59
#
#
# Counter values checked for 1248-J:
# ---------------------------------
# M55319C02009 (DL PDCP SDU volume transmitted for NSA Bearer - QoS Group 09)
# M55314C03009 (Downlink data volume received over F1-U - QoS Group 9)
# M55323C01009 (Downlink data volume sent over F1-U - QoS Group 9)
# M55323C04009 (Number of downlink PDCP PDU packet lost on F1-U interface- QoS Group 9) => Mettre 1000
# M55313C08009 (DL data volume sent over NR X2-U DL GTP-U tunnel - QoS Group 09)
# M55313C04009 (Number of downlink PDCP PDU packet lost on NR X2-U interface- QoS Group 09) => Mettre 1000
#
# Counters values check removed during 1248-J refactoring: (too sensistive and useless regarding 1248-J changes)
# M55320C06009 (DL PDCP SDUs discarded due to exceeding buffer threshold - QoS Group 09)
# M55320C09009 (DL PDCP SDUs discarded due to the exceeding Queuing delay - QoS Group 09)
# M55319C09009 (DL PDCP SDU delay - QoS Group 09)
# M55313C02009 (Downlink data volume received over X2-U DL data forwarding GTP-U tunnel - QoS Group 09)
# M55313C03009 (Downlink data volume discarded over X2-U DL data forwarding GTP-U tunnel - QoS Group 09)
# M55313C16009 (Downlink data volume sent over X2-U DL data forwarding GTP-U tunnel - QoS Group 09)
# M55112C00502 (Number of SGNB RELEASE REQUIRED message sent with cause equal to Radio Connection With UE lost)



