Test Teardown for 1248
    [Documentation]    Perform needed actions at the end of a test case
    Dated log                       Test teardown : start
    Run Keyword If                  ${enable_sherpa}==${True} and not ${isAic}    Sherpa.Deactivate Sherpa and Stop Collect
    Set Global variable             ${save_debug_data}                      ${False}
    # RDH: The following lines of code are removed as unnecessary: the Setup.robot "Test Teardown" only creates the SOS report if the test is FAIL.
    # Run Keyword If Test Failed      Set Global Variable                     ${save_debug_data}     ${True}
    # Run Keyword If                  ${AutoSaveDebugData} == ${True}         Set Global Variable    ${save_debug_data}    ${True}
    # "Test Teardown" KW from Setup.robot
    # Run Keyword If                  ${save_debug_data} == ${True}           Test Teardown

    # RDH: Reactivation of the "Test Teardown" and therefore execution of the SCOUT procedure regardless of the result of the test.
    Test Teardown
    Dated log                       Test teardown : end
